{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/986027-omen","id":986027,"title":"Omen!!!!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-12T03:35:56-07:00","id":986027,"title":"Omen!!!!","content":"Heard the news?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> &quot;when you hit Legend 3, and every third Legend after, you get an Omen that sort of\u2026sits on you. It\u2019s an expression of your divine nature. Could be the lack of an eye. Could be an animal head.&quot; </div> </div> </div>this is great! i'm wondering, is the Narrator who choose the omen? or the player can choose by himself?<br /> <br /> What do you think? what omen would you choose for your character?<br /> <br /> I'm totally thinking at a manitou's scion, with eagle's feathers growing in the Hairs<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12508,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12508-elanconnor","user":"ElanConnor","date":". 10-12-2016, 06:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12508-elanconnor","name":"ElanConnor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T05:32:20-07:00","id":986065,"title":"","content":"I hope it's the player chooses. If the ST can just decide I'd think that would interfere with player agency.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T06:32:00-07:00","id":986094,"title":"","content":"Yeah, especcially if it's &quot;always on&quot; having someone else decide that my character makes a squeaky sound whenever he punches something for example just wouldn't be fun. Now if I decided to do that that's something else entirely. I'd bet it's &quot;Player's choice pending gm approval&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8375-vonpenguin","name":"vonpenguin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T07:54:39-07:00","id":986133,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Resplendent Fire</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/986027-omen?p=986065#post986065\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hope it's the player chooses. If the ST can just decide I'd think that would interfere with player agency.</div> </div> </div> </div>Give 2E's Player-Narrative based structure, I think it's safe to say that the player can choose it, although as always, I'm sure there will be some GM negotiation involved.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12349-evilnerf","name":"evilne