to make a guardian and warrior calling Aseir that Channels Badgers during his beserker rage won't be nearly as awesome.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8375-vonpenguin","name":"vonpenguin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T13:19:47-07:00","id":986337,"title":"","content":"I want a pg with a soundtrack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12508-elanconnor","name":"ElanConnor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T14:23:15-07:00","id":986380,"title":"","content":"This would explain how Annie X has 4 arms in the art work seen so far (I'm guessing that is supposed to be Annie X... all artwork for her, save for her actual character picture in 1e Companion, has shown her with 4 arms... which is appropriate for a Scion of Kali).<br /> <br /> \u200bTo be honest, I think this mechanic will boil down to what both the player and ST think is appropriate, interesting and acceptable for a given character. Just as some ST could decide on something completely inappropriate... so too could a player do the same. In the end, it is likely to be a compromise between both player and ST, which it should generally be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are three types of people in the world... those who can count and those who can't.<br /> I reject your reality and substitute my own!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions